OL,3,GNEWSASpider-Man toy eases boy's
OL,4,Aartificial eye fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Spider-Man toy with a removable eye
OL,7,Fhas helped a four-year-old boy to
OL,8,Fovercome trauma associated with
OL,9,Ftreatment after losing his left eye to
OL,10,Fa rare childhood cancer.
OL,12,FFinn, from Worcester, needed a
OL,13,Fprosthetic eye after undergoing surgery
OL,14,Ffor retinoblastoma, but experienced
OL,15,Fsignificant anxiety and found it
OL,16,Fdifficult to allow doctors to touch or
OL,17,Fremove it.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
