OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASpider-Man toy eases boy's
OL,4,Aartificial eye fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Smith, a healthcare play
OL,7,Fspecialist at Worcestershire Royal
OL,8,FHospital, adapted Finn's favourite
OL,9,FSpider-man cuddly toy with a removable
OL,10,Feye, to help him understand and accept
OL,11,Fhis ongoing care.
OL,13,FThe four-year-old recently allowed his
OL,14,Fprosthetic eye to be removed, adjusted
OL,15,Fand replaced twice and told staff:
OL,16,F"Spidey got his eye polished too".
